desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "golang"
	title: "检测 Go crypto/rc4"
	title_zh: "检测 Go crypto/rc4"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-go-rc4"
	risk: "weak-cryptographic-algorithm"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
检测到 rc4.NewCipher 调用。仅匹配实际 RC4 API，不匹配 import "crypto/rc4"。

### 风险类型
weak-cryptographic-algorithm

### 影响
RC4 已被淘汰，不应用于新的机密性保护。实现既有协议、必须协商服务端算法时，应人工确认为协议兼容而非本项目可替换的漏洞。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配 rc4.NewCipher( 调用。
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
自有数据加密改用 AES-GCM。协议兼容实现不要强行替换，以免无法互通。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://c.go": <<<POS
package main
import "crypto/rc4"
func n(k []byte) { rc4.NewCipher(k) }

POS
	"safefile://s.go": <<<NEG
package main
func n() {}

NEG
	"safefile://import-only.go": <<<NEG
package main
import _ "crypto/rc4"
func n() {}

NEG
)

${*.go}.pattern_regex(/\brc4\.NewCipher\s*\(/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "检测 Go crypto/rc4",
	title_zh: "检测 Go crypto/rc4",
	message: "检测 Go crypto/rc4",
	risk: "weak-cryptographic-algorithm",
}
